    "value": "∀ (X : Type u) [inst : MeasurableSpace X] (C : ConceptClass X Bool) [MeasurableHypotheses X C] (L : BatchLearner X Bool)\n  [MeasurableBatchLearner X L] (rate : ℕ → ℝ),\n  (∀ ε > 0, ∃ m₀, ∀ m ≥ m₀, rate m < ε) →\n    (∀ (D : MeasureTheory.Measure X),\n        MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure D →\n          ∀ c ∈ C,\n            ∀ (m : ℕ),\n              (MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => D)\n                  {xs | D {x | L.learn (fun i => (xs i, c (xs i))) x ≠ c x} ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (rate m)} ≥\n                ENNReal.ofReal (2 / 3)) →\n      PACLearnable X C"
