    "field": "argument_node.kind",
    "value": "theorem"
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type u} [inst : MeasurableSpace X] (D : MeasureTheory.Measure X) [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure D]\n  (c : Concept X Bool),\n  Measurable c →\n    ∀ (L : BatchLearner X Bool) [MeasurableBatchLearner X L] (rate : ℕ → ℝ) (k n : ℕ) (ω : Fin (k * n) → X),\n      0 < k →\n        7 * k ≤ 12 * {j | ω ∈ goodBlockEvent✝ L D c rate k n j}.card →\n          D\n              {x |\n                (boosted_majority✝ k fun j =>\n                    L.learn (fun i => (block_extract k n ω j i, c (block_extract k n ω j i))) x) ≠\n                  c x} ≤\n            ENNReal.ofReal (7 * max (rate n) 0)"
  },
  {
